@VolvoHackathon.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5137

### Next summary for the web app (empty summary if nothing is waiting) and all agent statuses
GET {{VolvoHackathon.Api_HostAddress}}/api/factory
Accept: application/json

### Send a summary to the web app's chat
POST {{VolvoHackathon.Api_HostAddress}}/api/factory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "summary": "Agent 3: Line B stopped for maintenance."
}

### Set whether all 5 agents are running (index 0 = Agent 1)
PUT {{VolvoHackathon.Api_HostAddress}}/api/factory/agents
Content-Type: application/json

[true, true, true, false, true]

### Set whether one agent is running (3 = Agent 4)
PUT {{VolvoHackathon.Api_HostAddress}}/api/factory/agents/3
Content-Type: application/json

true

###
